              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uchakaia na ndighi nyingi, ela si kwa kudima kwake. Uchanona hata uoboshe wandu, na kula ilagho uchaabonya jichasima. Uchawitotesha wandu wiwadie ndighi, na waeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uchatumia mikalo upate kuwona nicha, nao uchakughesha moni kukaia m'baa. Uchawitotesha wengi wisemanyire, wikikaia na sere. Uchatima hata kulwa na M'baa wa wabaa, ela uchasia moni usekabilo ni mdamu ungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho mawono gha vizongona va nakenyi na va nakesho kuwonyero ni gha loli. Ela kuseghighore, angu ni gha ngelo nyingi richagha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.26"
            ]
          }
